    "slides": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "At thirty-four, you sit in your quiet apartment, enjoying coffee before a day that belongs entirely to you.",
        "closing": false,
        "text_tone": "DARK",
        "logo_tone": "DARK",
        "footer_tone": "OLIVE",
        "accent": "OLIVE"
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "At your age, your grandmother raised four children in a four-room house, her days measured by laundry and meals.",
        "closing": false,
        "text_tone": "DARK",
        "logo_tone": "DARK",
        "footer_tone": "OLIVE",
        "accent": "OLIVE"
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "You remember her sharp tone when the screen door slammed, a sharpness you once attributed to a strict temperament.",
        "closing": false,
        "text_tone": "DARK",
        "logo_tone": "DARK",
        "footer_tone": "OLIVE",
        "accent": "OLIVE"
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "text": "In your empty morning, you realize her sharpness wasn't a defect, but fatigue from never having an hour to herself.",
        "closing": false,
        "text_tone": "DARK",
        "logo_tone": "DARK",
        "footer_tone": "OLIVE",
        "accent": "OLIVE"
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "text": "Vast shifts in generational opportunity can easily hide the quiet, constant sacrifice of those whose circumstances never offered room to rest.",
        "closing": true,
        "text_tone": "DARK",
        "logo_tone": "DARK",
        "footer_tone": "OLIVE",
        "accent": "OLIVE"
      }
    ]
